Package: saemMicrobiome
Title: SAEM Models for Longitudinal Microbiome Data
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gabriela", "Gutierrez", email = "gabriella.gutierrez.bernal@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("John", "Barrera", role = "ctb", comment = "Original author of the SAEM estimation method for ZIBR and ZIBBMR"))
Description: Implementation of ZIBR and ZIBBMR models for longitudinal
    microbiome data, including a mother function to select the model type.
    The SAEM estimation algorithm was originally developed by John Barrera.
